  "body": "The post-merge batch gate failed on `470d1a27c30256e8a6d1b63260f744b61e312263`.\n\nRun: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/45989848887\n\nFailing steps:\n```\n     FAIL in 135s failed: tests/example_catalog.rs [tests: catalog_3d_rough_finish::rebuilds, catalog_3d_rough_finish::regenerates] slow: catalog_3d_rough_finish::rebuilds (>60s), catalog_3d_rough_finish::regenerates (>60s)\n```\n\nEach push to main has its own run, so this run gates exactly this commit. If the run of the commit before it is green, this commit broke main. Fix it in the normal order; this issue closes itself on the next green run.\n\n<!-- post-merge-last-sha: 2cc90afd8650a3c48a45725e30b30397d1889a99 -->",
